{'symbol': 'LYB', 'date': '2022-04-21 16:15:00', 'title': 'LYONDELLBASELL ANNOUNCES PLANS TO EXIT REFINING BUSINESS', 'text': 'HOUSTON , APRIL 21, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- LYONDELLBASELL (NYSE: LYB) TODAY ANNOUNCED ITS DECISION TO CEASE OPERATION OF ITS HOUSTON REFINERY NO LATER THAN DECEMBER 31, 2023. IN THE INTERIM, THE COMPANY WILL CONTINUE SERVING THE FUELS MARKET, WHICH IS EXPECTED TO REMAIN STRONG IN THE NEAR-TERM, AND CONSIDER POTENTIAL TRANSACTIONS AND ALTERNATIVES FOR THE SITE.'}